<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Responsive CSS Example</title>

    <style>
        .box {
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: lightblue;
            border: 2px solid blue;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
        }


        p {
            font-size: medium;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 5vw;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            
        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Responsive Web Design</h1>

    <br>

    <div class="box">
     BOX
    </div>
    <br>
    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Ab odio dolore porro, eveniet, et consequatur repellat officia labore, quo deserunt iusto eum eaque nulla ratione explicabo incidunt laboriosam distinctio architecto.</p>

</body>
</html>
